  "notes": [
    "DRAFT: a skeleton from the world database export of map 807, prepped in task B1 (TortoiseBots-audit RAID-PREP-es) from the world DB, the core's emerald_sanctum scripts and the server's map 807 navmesh. Not mapped, not live-checked: the GM-invisible mapping walk (B2) and the first live run are still to do; dungeon_run refuses it without allow_draft.",
    "Packs: the export's 69 pull groups become 13. The map has 85 hostile trash spawns in 10 creature_linking groups (flag 3, 5-12 units each) plus 3 lone waypoint patrols (60744 at guid 2570738, 60746 at 2570819 and 2570821). A linked group is one pull, radius = its spread from the centre + 0.5 yd (6.3-17.2), under the 16-unit cap of a 40-man; a patrol is never merged into a trash pull. The 44 Deer (883, level 5, faction 28 'Prey') and 27 Toads (1420, level 1, faction 148 'Ambient') are in no pull.",
    "Boss order: Erennius (60747) dies before Solnius (60748). Solnius' EnterCombat sets hard mode while Erennius lives, engages him, and puts every living trash unit of the map in combat with the attacker (instance_emerald_sanctum::GetTrashGUID), so every pull comes before him. Solnius is friendly (faction 35, npc_flags 1) until the one option of his gossip menu is taken (menu 92950, boss_solnius.cpp): the leg talks to him (menu index 0, by the tank), then fights.",
    "Erennius patrols a 32-point loop of 1323.5 yd (529 s at 2.5 yd/s, creature_movement guid 2570746) that crosses the east hall's packs (one point stands 1 yd from a unit of pack 2570797, and the loop passes 2577570 and 2577574): he is engaged at his spawn 3293.46 3130.04 before the east packs. A boss has no patrol block, so his loop is a note: B2 measures where the patrol meets the raid.",
    "Solnius at 60 % health sleeps and summons 3 portals, each with a major add (Dragonkin, Wyrmkin, Scalebane or Supressor) and a Dreamer, then below 40 % casts Emerald Rot on 4 targets every 30 s (boss_solnius.cpp): the plan has no step inside the fight; the bots' own `solnius` strategy flanks the Acid Breath, runs Emerald Rot carriers out and focuses the adds (EmeraldSanctumDungeonStrategies.cpp).",
    "Patrols: 4 map 807 spawns have a waypoint path (creature_movement): Erennius and the 3 lone trash units above. The 3 lone patrols are one-unit pulls with a patrol block (path, period_s estimated at 2.5 yd/s, source guid), so the agent's driver waits for them or pulls them alone; the run leader's rows have no patrol block (plan-export warns), so a patrol unit away from its spawn when its step runs may be passed, and Solnius then engages it: B2 watches the three.",
    "Doors and events: map 807 has 3 game objects, all 'Ghost Gate' generic visuals at the entrance (180322 at 2735.8 2956.9 and 2745.0 2942.6, 2010866 at 2708.5 3049.7); no door, lever, gong, altar or key gates the route. The chest Solnius summons (2020042) and the portals (177243) are script objects, no plan step.",
    "Tactics: no ai_boss_tactic row. Solnius' Acid Breath flank and Emerald Rot runout are already the bots' own `solnius` strategy, so a `behind` row would duplicate it; Erennius' casts (Poison Bolt Volley, Call of Nightmare, Howl of Erennius, Curse of Erennius) and the trash casts are script-side, and the Turtle Spell.dbc is not in this offline data set, so no interrupt row is invented."
  ],
